<p><br></p>
<h2>6. Load a placement</h2>
<p>In order to load a Prodege Ad Unit placement, you will just need the pla=
cement id as provided by the <a href=3D"https://www.pollfish.com/dashboard/=
dev/" target=3D"_blank">Publisher Dashboard</a> in step 3. This will load a=
 placement with default configuration. Read further for additional configur=
ation options and notfications on the loading result.</p>
<p>Depending on the AdUnit type you should use the corresponding method to =
load your placement.</p>
<h3><strong>6.1. Load a Rewarded Ad Unit placement</strong></h3>
<p><span style=3D"text-decoration: underline">Kotlin:</span></p>
<pre><code class=3D"language-kotlin hljs">Prodege.loadRewardedAd(<span clas=
s=3D"hljs-string">"PLACEMENT_ID"</span>)
</code></pre>
