<pre><code class=3D"language-java hljs">Prodege.loadRewardedAd(<span class=
=3D"hljs-string">"PLACEMENT_ID"</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">null</=
span>, <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">null</span>);
</code></pre>
<p><br></p>
<h3>6.1.1. Listen for the placement loading result (Optional)</h3>
<p>In order to get notified for the placement loading result you will have =
to pass a <code>ProdegeRewardedLoadListener</code> interface implementation=
