ts</span> <span class=3D"hljs-title">ProdegeRewardedLoadListener</span> </s=
pan>{
    <span class=3D"hljs-comment">// ...</span>
   =20
    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">private</spa=
